            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Station",
            "review_text": "Jose M\nMadrid, Spain9 contributions\n1\nThe best sushi experience in Hanoi\nAug 2018 • Solo\nI have visited this restaurant by chance!! The food was delicious the service incredible and very friendly... I had a very nice lunch at a very affordable price. The owner was very friendly and tried he’s best to make my lunch a very good experience!\n\nThe restaurant location is incredible with a very nice view and very quiet, the best place to have lunch and dinner... is like a small oasis in the middle of the city.. \n\nI’ll be back for sure and I highly recommend to visit this restaurant and try incredible dishes and a nice conversation with the owner!!\nRead more\nWritten October 17, 2018",
